  "title": "Inside Out Ravioli",
  "description": "This inside-out ravioli recipe includes what you&#39;d expect stuffed in a ravioli: spinach, bread crumbs, and cheese, plus pasta and a meaty tomato sauce.",
  "authors": [
    "Amy Brolsma"
